<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper A · Answer guide</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Paper A · Answer guide</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 20 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. What will the man do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 今天的家务怎么分？你打扫客厅，我洗碗，好吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 我更想洗碗，客厅请你打扫，可以吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 好，那就这样。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 打扫客厅</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 洗碗</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 买菜</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The man proposes washing the dishes and the woman agrees.</p><p class="cn">男生提出自己洗碗，女生同意了。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我更想洗碗，客厅请你打扫</p><ul><li>A: Cleaning the living room was his first assignment, then they changed it.<br>打扫客厅是原先分工，后来改变了。</li><li>C: Buying groceries is not assigned.<br>材料没有分配买菜任务。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. When does the community activity begin?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 社区活动星期六十点开始。我九点要在家打扫厨房，九点半出门。活动十二点结束以后，我再去买菜。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 九点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十二点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The activity begins at ten.</p><p class="cn">活动十点开始。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 社区活动星期六十点开始</p><ul><li>B: Nine thirty is his departure time.<br>九点半是出门时间。</li><li>C: Twelve is the finishing time.<br>十二点是活动结束时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. How often does the speaker wash dishes each week?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 我平时每天晚上洗碗，星期六和星期日不用洗，因为这两天爸爸做家务。我每个星期洗五次，每次大约十分钟。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两次</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十次</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五次</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>She explicitly says five times a week.</p><p class="cn">她明确说每周洗五次。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我每个星期洗五次</p><ul><li>A: Two refers to the days her father takes over.<br>两天是爸爸接手家务的周末。</li><li>B: Ten is the number of minutes per occasion.<br>十是每次所需的分钟数。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Which walking plan fits the woman’s work schedule?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 你平时六点散步，今天也一样吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 今天六点要开会，七点才下班。我想下班后走半个小时。</p><p class="cn">male · 那我七点在楼下等你。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 七点到七点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六点到六点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 七点到八点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>She finishes at seven and wants a half-hour walk.</p><p class="cn">七点下班，走半小时，到七点半。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 七点才下班。我想下班后走半个小时</p><ul><li>B: She has a meeting at six.<br>六点她要开会。</li><li>C: An hour is longer than her stated half hour.<br>七点到八点是一小时，不是半小时。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Which change is supported by Xiao’an’s experience?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 小安最近每天晚上看电视到十二点，第二天起床总觉得累。昨天她十点就关了电视，今天早上起床的时候觉得舒服多了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每天晚些起床</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 晚上早点休息</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 每天多看电视</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Her reported improvement follows an earlier end to the evening; resting earlier fits that evidence.</p><p class="cn">早点结束晚间活动后感觉改善，支持早点休息。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 昨天她十点就关了电视，今天早上起床的时候觉得舒服多了</p><ul><li>A: The source does not say she changed her waking time.<br>材料没有说改变起床时间。</li><li>C: More television is contrary to the change associated with feeling better.<br>感觉改善对应的是早点关电视，不是多看。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. Where will the woman go first?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 你现在去市场吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 不是，我先去图书馆还书。还完书再到对面的市场买菜，中午回家做饭。</p><p class="cn">male · 那我在图书馆门口等你。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 市场</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 家里</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 图书馆</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>She first goes to the library to return books.</p><p class="cn">她先去图书馆还书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我先去图书馆还书</p><ul><li>A: The market comes after the library.<br>市场在图书馆之后去。</li><li>B: She returns home at midday, after the errands.<br>中午办完事后才回家。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. How will they get to the library?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 去图书馆坐地铁只要十分钟，我们坐地铁吧。</p><p class="cn">male · 今天地铁站不开门，还是坐公交车吧，二十分钟能到。</p><p class="cn">female · 好，我去车站等你。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 坐公交车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 坐地铁</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 走路</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The final accepted choice is the bus.</p><p class="cn">最后同意坐公交车。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 还是坐公交车吧，二十分钟能到</p><ul><li>B: The subway is the rejected initial proposal because the station is closed.<br>地铁是最初建议，但站点不开门。</li><li>C: Walking is not their agreed method.<br>双方没有约定走路。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. What should the man do just after getting off the bus?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 从车站到图书馆怎么走？</p><p class="cn">female · 下车后先向右走，到第一个路口再向左。图书馆就在银行旁边，不用过马路。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我记住了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 向左走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 向右走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 过马路</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The first step is to walk right.</p><p class="cn">下车后的第一步是向右走。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 下车后先向右走</p><ul><li>A: Turning left happens at the first intersection later.<br>向左是在之后到达第一个路口时。</li><li>C: He is told that crossing the road is unnecessary.<br>材料明确说不用过马路。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which route meets the man’s stated needs tonight?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 去图书馆有两条路。走河边比较近，可是没有灯；走商店那边远五分钟，但是一路都有灯。</p><p class="cn">male · 现在天黑了，我不着急，走商店那边吧。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 河边的路</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两条路都不走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 商店那边的路</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>It is dark, he has time, and the shop route has lights.</p><p class="cn">天黑又不着急，有灯的商店路线符合条件。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 走商店那边远五分钟，但是一路都有灯</p><ul><li>A: The river route is shorter but unlit.<br>河边近但没有灯，不符合晚上的选择依据。</li><li>B: He chooses a route rather than cancelling the trip.<br>男生已经选择路线，没有取消出行。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. What is the final meeting arrangement?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 明天上午下雨，原来九点在公园见的活动怎么办？</p><p class="cn">female · 改在图书馆吧。不过图书馆十点才开门，我们十点半见。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，就这么定了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点在公园</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十点半在图书馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十点在公园</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>They change both the place and meeting time to ten thirty at the library.</p><p class="cn">地点改为图书馆，见面时间改为十点半。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 改在图书馆吧。不过图书馆十点才开门，我们十点半见</p><ul><li>A: Nine in the park is the original arrangement replaced because of rain.<br>九点公园见是因下雨而改变的原安排。</li><li>C: Ten is opening time, and the park is no longer the location.<br>十点是图书馆开门时间，地点也不是公园。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. How many bowls of noodles will they order?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 我们四个人，一人一碗面，好吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 我和哥哥想吃米饭，妈妈和妹妹吃面。</p><p class="cn">female · 那就两碗面、两份米饭，再点一个菜。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两碗</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四碗</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一碗</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The final order contains two bowls of noodles.</p><p class="cn">最后点两碗面。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那就两碗面、两份米饭</p><ul><li>B: Four was the earlier proposal for all four people.<br>四碗是原先让四个人都吃面的建议。</li><li>C: One is the number of additional dishes, not bowls of noodles.<br>一个指另外点的菜，不是面的数量。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Which item does the woman want?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 这件小号的衣服好看，你试过了吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 试过了，太小。我想买大号，颜色还是蓝色，不要红色。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我帮你找蓝色大号。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 蓝色小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 红色大号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 蓝色大号</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>She wants the large size in blue.</p><p class="cn">她要蓝色大号。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我想买大号，颜色还是蓝色，不要红色</p><ul><li>A: The small blue item is too small.<br>蓝色小号已经试过，太小。</li><li>B: She explicitly rejects red.<br>她明确不要红色。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. How much does the man’s order cost?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 这份午饭十五块，汤另外三块。</p><p class="cn">male · 我只要午饭，不要汤。给你二十块。</p><p class="cn">female · 好的，午饭十五块，找你五块。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十八块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十五块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二十块</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>His meal costs fifteen; he does not order soup.</p><p class="cn">他只买十五块的午饭，没有要汤。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 午饭十五块，找你五块</p><ul><li>A: Eighteen would include the soup he declined.<br>十八块包含他不要的汤。</li><li>C: Twenty is the money handed over, not the bill.<br>二十块是付出的金额，不是账单。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. Which dish meets both guests’ food requirements?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 小林不吃辣，小周不吃肉，晚上点什么好？</p><p class="cn">female · 辣牛肉不行。鸡蛋面没有肉，也不辣，十八块；白菜汤虽然便宜，但大家想吃面。</p><p class="cn">male · 那就点鸡蛋面。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 鸡蛋面</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 辣牛肉</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白菜汤</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Egg noodles satisfy both no-meat and no-spice needs and match the preference for noodles.</p><p class="cn">鸡蛋面既不辣又没有肉，也符合想吃面的偏好。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 鸡蛋面没有肉，也不辣</p><ul><li>B: Spicy beef violates both stated requirements.<br>辣牛肉同时不符合不辣和不吃肉的要求。</li><li>C: Cabbage soup does not match the stated desire for noodles.<br>白菜汤不符合大家想吃面的要求。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. What is the man’s final household job this evening?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 家里没有牛奶了，你下班后去买两瓶吧。</p><p class="cn">male · 我今天五点要开会，商店六点关门，恐怕来不及。</p><p class="cn">female · 那我现在去，你晚上回来洗碗就好。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下班后买牛奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 现在去商店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 洗碗</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The final reassignment is for him to wash dishes after returning.</p><p class="cn">最后分工是男生回来洗碗。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那我现在去，你晚上回来洗碗就好</p><ul><li>A: The purchase request is reassigned because of his meeting and closing time.<br>买牛奶因开会和关门时间被重新分配。</li><li>B: The woman says she will go now.<br>现在去商店的是女生。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. What weather is expected this afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 今天早上有点儿冷，还下了小雨。天气预报说下午不下雨了，会出太阳，最高二十度。我们下午再去公园，不用现在出门。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 晴天</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 继续下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下雪</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The forecast says the sun will come out in the afternoon.</p><p class="cn">预报说下午会出太阳。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 下午不下雨了，会出太阳</p><ul><li>B: Rain belongs to the morning, not the afternoon forecast.<br>下雨是早上的情况，不是下午预报。</li><li>C: Snow is not forecast.<br>材料没有预报下雪。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. Why was the activity moved to the community centre?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 周日天气很好，为什么不在公园做活动？</p><p class="cn">male · 公园的门坏了，周日不开。我们改在社区中心，时间还是下午两点。</p><p class="cn">female · 原来是这样。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周日会下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 公园周日不开</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大家上午没空</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The park is closed on Sunday because of the broken gate.</p><p class="cn">公园因门坏了周日不开。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 公园的门坏了，周日不开</p><ul><li>A: The woman says the weather will be good.<br>女生说天气很好，没有下雨的原因。</li><li>C: The move is not attributed to anyone being busy in the morning.<br>材料没有以大家上午忙解释改地点。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. Which walk fits the man’s available time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我今天想散步，但是只能走二十分钟。</p><p class="cn">female · 去湖边来回要四十分钟，小区里的路来回十五分钟。你走完以后还可以休息一会儿。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，就在小区里走。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 湖边来回四十分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两个地方都走一遍</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小区里来回十五分钟</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The fifteen-minute neighbourhood walk fits within twenty minutes.</p><p class="cn">小区十五分钟的来回路线在二十分钟以内。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我今天想散步，但是只能走二十分钟。</p><ul><li>A: Forty minutes exceeds his limit.<br>四十分钟超过他的时间。</li><li>B: Doing both would exceed the limit too.<br>两条都走也超过时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What did the group do immediately after watching the singing?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 上周我们去社区参加春节活动。先看小朋友唱歌，再跟老师写汉字。写完字以后，大家一起吃午饭。我第一次参加这样的活动，觉得很有意思。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 跟老师写汉字</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一起吃午饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先回家</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Writing characters follows the singing.</p><p class="cn">唱歌后紧接着跟老师写字。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 先看小朋友唱歌，再跟老师写汉字</p><ul><li>B: Lunch is after writing, not immediately after singing.<br>午饭在写字之后。</li><li>C: Going home is not the next stated step.<br>材料没有说之后先回家。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What can we infer about Xiaoyu’s view of the activity?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 第一次去社区春节活动的时候，小雨只想待半个小时。后来活动结束了，她还在问下次什么时候再办，又告诉妹妹下次一定要一起来。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 她一直不想参加</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 她后来很喜欢这个活动</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 她只想知道回家的路</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Asking to return and inviting her sister support enjoyment after her initial hesitation.</p><p class="cn">问下一次并邀请妹妹，支持后来喜欢活动的推断。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 还在问下次什么时候再办，又告诉妹妹下次一定要一起来</p><ul><li>A: Her later behaviour contradicts continuing unwillingness.<br>后来的表现不支持一直不想参加。</li><li>C: Her questions concern a future event, not a route home.<br>她问的是下次活动，不是回家路线。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 25 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What does the mother ask Xiaolin to do?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家务留言<br>小林：我今天要带奶奶去社区中心，不能擦桌子了。请你下午把桌子擦一下，我晚上回来再洗衣服。地已经扫过，你不用再扫。谢谢！<br>妈妈</p></div><p class="note">擦: wipe</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 擦桌子</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 洗衣服</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 扫地</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The request to Xiaolin is to wipe the table.</p><p class="cn">妈妈请小林擦桌子。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请你下午把桌子擦一下</p><ul><li>B: The mother will wash clothes herself that evening.<br>洗衣服是妈妈晚上回来的安排。</li><li>C: The floor has already been swept and needs no repeat.<br>地已经扫过，明确不用再扫。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. When does the cooking activity now begin?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">社区通知<br>原定星期六上午九点的做饭活动改为下午两点开始，四点结束。请一点半以后到一楼厨房，不要去二楼教室。上午厨房要打扫，不能提前使用。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午两点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午一点半</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Two in the afternoon is the new starting time.</p><p class="cn">新的开始时间是下午两点。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 改为下午两点开始</p><ul><li>A: Nine was the original time, now replaced.<br>上午九点是被更改的原时间。</li><li>C: One thirty is the earliest arrival time, not the start.<br>一点半是可以到场的时间，不是开始时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How many times will Xiaoning water the plants this week?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小宁家的安排<br>周一、周三、周五：小宁给花浇水，每次十分钟。<br>周二、周四：爸爸浇水。<br>周末：妈妈浇水。<br>小宁这周在家，也按这个安排做，没有和家人交换。</p></div><p class="note">浇水: water plants</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两次</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五次</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三次</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Monday, Wednesday and Friday make three occasions.</p><p class="cn">周一、三、五共三次。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 周一、周三、周五：小宁给花浇水</p><ul><li>A: Two is the father’s weekday allocation.<br>两次是爸爸的安排。</li><li>B: Five combines the child’s and father’s weekdays.<br>五次把小宁和爸爸的工作日都加上了。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Which walk fits Lin An’s time and the opening information?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">林安的记录<br>这周下班后六点半到家，七点吃晚饭。附近的公园每天晚上六点关门，小区里的路一直可以走。林安想在晚饭前散步二十分钟，也想留十分钟休息。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六点半到六点五十分在公园走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六点半到六点五十分在小区走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 六点半到七点十分在小区走</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The neighbourhood is open; a twenty-minute walk leaves ten minutes before dinner.</p><p class="cn">小区可以走，走二十分钟后还剩十分钟到晚饭。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 六点半到家，七点吃晚饭</p><ul><li>A: The park is already closed when Lin An gets home.<br>六点半到家时公园已经关门。</li><li>C: This walk lasts forty minutes and extends past dinner time.<br>该路线四十分钟，超过七点晚饭时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Which plan does Xiaozhou’s diary support continuing?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小周的运动日记<br>以前我一周只运动一次，每次跑一个小时，第二天很累。从上周开始，我每周二、周四、周六各走二十分钟。三次都没有觉得累，我想下周继续这样做。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每周走三次，每次二十分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 每次跑一个小时</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一周完全不运动</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The new three-short-walk pattern is comfortable and is what the writer wants to repeat.</p><p class="cn">三次短走后不累，作者想继续这个安排。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 每周二、周四、周六各走二十分钟。三次都没有觉得累</p><ul><li>B: The earlier hour-long run left the writer tired.<br>过去跑一小时后第二天很累。</li><li>C: The writer wants to continue activity, not stop it.<br>作者想继续运动，不是完全停止。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Where should Xiaochen go first?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陈：今天先到社区中心帮忙吧，图书馆的书明天还也可以。我们在社区中心门口见。活动结束后，我再陪你去市场。别先去图书馆，我怕在那里找不到你。<br>小许</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 图书馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 市场</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 社区中心</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The message explicitly says to go first to the community centre.</p><p class="cn">留言明确要求先到社区中心。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 今天先到社区中心帮忙吧</p><ul><li>A: The library visit can wait until tomorrow.<br>图书馆还书可以等明天。</li><li>B: The market visit follows the activity.<br>市场在活动结束后才去。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Which transport does the notice ask visitors to use?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">图书馆交通提醒<br>本周六地铁二号线不开，去图书馆请坐十路公交车，在书店站下车。十路车每十五分钟一班。图书馆旁边没有停车的地方，请不要开车来。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 地铁二号线</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十路公交车</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 自己开车</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The instruction is to take bus number ten.</p><p class="cn">通知要求坐十路公交车。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 去图书馆请坐十路公交车</p><ul><li>A: Subway line two is not running that Saturday.<br>周六地铁二号线不开。</li><li>C: Drivers are asked not to come by car because there is no parking.<br>没有停车的地方，通知请大家不要开车。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What is the first direction after leaving the bus?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">从书店站到图书馆<br>下车后，先沿着书店前面的路往左走。到第二个路口再向右，经过一家小商店就能看见图书馆。不要在第一个路口转弯，那里通向学校。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 往左走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 在第一个路口右转</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先走进学校</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The first instruction is to walk left.</p><p class="cn">第一步是往左走。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 下车后，先沿着书店前面的路往左走</p><ul><li>B: The notice explicitly says not to turn at the first intersection.<br>通知明确说不要在第一个路口转弯。</li><li>C: The school is a wrong destination off that first intersection.<br>学校是第一个路口通向的地方，不是先去的目的地。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Which route best fits Xiaofang’s stated situation?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">路线卡<br>甲：走河边，十分钟到，中间没有可以坐的地方。<br>乙：走商店街，二十分钟到，中间有三张长椅。<br>小方今天有四十分钟空闲，想陪走路容易累的爷爷去图书馆。</p></div><p class="note">长椅: bench</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲，河边</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两条都一定来不及</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙，商店街</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The shop route fits the available time and offers places for the grandfather to rest.</p><p class="cn">商店街二十分钟在可用时间内，也有地方让爷爷休息。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 乙：走商店街，二十分钟到，中间有三张长椅</p><ul><li>A: The shorter route has no resting places for the stated need.<br>河边虽近，却没有符合需要的休息位置。</li><li>B: Both listed one-way travel times are below forty minutes.<br>两条所列单程时间都少于四十分钟，不能说一定来不及。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. What is the updated time and place?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">活动更新<br>明天有大雨，原来上午十点在河边画画的活动改到社区中心三楼。三楼上午有课，只能下午使用，所以请大家下午一点到。画画材料不用自己带。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午一点，社区中心三楼</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 上午十点，河边</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 上午十点，社区中心三楼</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Rain moves the event indoors, and the morning class means it starts at one.</p><p class="cn">因大雨改到三楼，又因上午有课改为下午一点。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 所以请大家下午一点到</p><ul><li>B: This is the original outdoor arrangement.<br>这是原来的户外安排。</li><li>C: The third floor is occupied by a class in the morning.<br>三楼上午有课，不能十点使用。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How many portions of rice are on the order?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">订单确认<br>米饭三份、面条一碗、青菜两份、热茶一壶。四位客人里只有小安吃面条，其他三位吃米饭。店员请大家检查数量，确认后再开始做饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一份</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三份</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四份</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The order lists three portions of rice.</p><p class="cn">订单列出三份米饭。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 米饭三份、面条一碗</p><ul><li>A: One is the bowl of noodles.<br>一碗指面条。</li><li>C: Four is the number of diners, one of whom eats noodles instead.<br>四是客人人数，其中一人吃面。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which apron does Xiao’an request?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小方：你上次买的白色小号围裙我试过了，做饭时太紧。这次请帮我买中号，颜色还是白色，不要黄色。店里如果没有白色中号，就先别买。<br>小安</p></div><p class="note">围裙: apron</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白色小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 黄色中号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白色中号</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The request is for a white medium apron.</p><p class="cn">留言要求白色中号围裙。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 这次请帮我买中号，颜色还是白色，不要黄色</p><ul><li>A: The small apron was tried and is too tight.<br>小号已经试过，太紧。</li><li>B: Yellow is explicitly rejected.<br>留言明确不要黄色。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. What is the total cost of the meal?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">午饭账单<br>面条：十六元。<br>青菜：六元。<br>热茶：免费。<br>应付：二十二元。<br>客人付了三十元，店员找回八元。客人没有另外买饮料，账单已经结清。</p></div><p class="note">账单: bill</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二十二元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八元</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The amount due is twenty-two yuan.</p><p class="cn">应付金额是二十二元。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 应付：二十二元</p><ul><li>B: Thirty yuan is the amount handed over.<br>三十元是客人付出的金额。</li><li>C: Eight yuan is the change returned.<br>八元是找回的钱。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Which purchase meets the quantity and budget requirements?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">采购卡<br>周末四个人来家里，每人需要一瓶水。甲店四瓶八元，乙店三瓶六元，丙店四瓶十二元。小周最多带十元，只能去一家店，不想有人没有水喝。</p></div><p class="note">采购: purchase supplies</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 乙店三瓶六元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 甲店四瓶八元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙店四瓶十二元</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Four bottles cover four people, and eight yuan stays within ten.</p><p class="cn">四瓶够四个人，八元不超过十元。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 甲店四瓶八元</p><ul><li>A: Three bottles leave one person without a bottle.<br>三瓶不够四个人每人一瓶。</li><li>C: Twelve yuan exceeds the ten-yuan budget.<br>十二元超过十元预算。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. What should Xiaoning do first after class?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">爸爸的留言<br>客人六点来，家里的杯子不够。小宁五点下课，回家路上的商店五点半关门。请小宁下课先买杯子再回家。我五点半回来做饭，买菜已经办好了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 先回家等爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先去买菜</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 在回家路上买杯子</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The requested sequence is to buy cups before returning home.</p><p class="cn">明确要求先买杯子再回家。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请小宁下课先买杯子再回家</p><ul><li>A: Waiting at home first risks missing the shop’s closing time.<br>先回家等爸爸会错过商店关门前的安排。</li><li>B: Groceries have already been bought.<br>买菜已经办好，无需小宁再买。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. What is the forecast for Saturday afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周六天气<br>上午：多云，十八度。<br>下午：下雨，十六度。<br>晚上：雨停，有风。<br>公园活动负责人提醒：想在外面拍照的同学请上午来，下午的活动改在室内。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 有太阳</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 雨停了</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The afternoon forecast explicitly says rain.</p><p class="cn">下午预报明确是下雨。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 下午：下雨，十六度</p><ul><li>A: Sunshine is not the afternoon forecast.<br>下午没有预报太阳。</li><li>C: The rain stops in the evening, not the afternoon.<br>雨停是在晚上，不是下午。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. Why did they choose the afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林：周日上午天气很好，我们上午去公园吧。<br>小方：我上午要在家照顾弟弟，妈妈十二点才回来。下午我有空，公园也开门。<br>小林：好，那下午两点在公园门口见。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小方上午要照顾弟弟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 公园上午不开</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 上午天气不好</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Xiaofang has a family duty until the mother returns at noon.</p><p class="cn">小方上午要照顾弟弟，妈妈中午才回来。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我上午要在家照顾弟弟，妈妈十二点才回来</p><ul><li>B: The text does not state a morning closure.<br>材料没有说公园上午不开。</li><li>C: The morning weather is explicitly described as good.<br>材料明确说上午天气很好。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which route leaves the requested resting time?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">散步选择<br>小安午饭后一共只有三十分钟，还想留十分钟坐着休息。公园路线要走二十五分钟，小区路线要走十五分钟。两条路都平坦，今天也都开放。</p></div><p class="note">平坦: flat, even</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 公园二十五分钟路线</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两条路线都走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小区十五分钟路线</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Fifteen minutes walking leaves fifteen minutes, enough for the requested ten-minute rest.</p><p class="cn">走十五分钟还剩十五分钟，足够休息十分钟。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 一共只有三十分钟，还想留十分钟坐着休息</p><ul><li>A: A twenty-five-minute walk leaves only five minutes.<br>走二十五分钟只剩五分钟，不够休息十分钟。</li><li>B: Walking both takes forty minutes before any rest.<br>两条都走需四十分钟，尚未包含休息。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What did the group do just after making the little paper lanterns?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">社区春节日记<br>星期日我们九点到社区中心，先跟老师做红色的小纸灯，再把灯放到门口。十点大家坐下来听故事，十一点一起包饺子。午饭后我把自己做的灯带回家了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一起包饺子</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 把灯放到门口</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把灯带回家</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Putting lanterns by the entrance directly follows making them.</p><p class="cn">做灯后紧接着把灯放到门口。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 先跟老师做红色的小纸灯，再把灯放到门口</p><ul><li>A: Dumpling-making is later, at eleven.<br>包饺子在之后十一点。</li><li>C: Taking the lantern home is after lunch.<br>把灯带回家在午饭之后。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What does Xiao’an’s behaviour suggest about a future visit?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小安的消息<br>昨天第一次去社区的春节活动，我原来怕自己听不懂。回来后，我把活动照片发给朋友，还问老师下次能不能带朋友一起参加。我已经把下次活动的日期写进日历了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 她愿意再去参加</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 她决定不再参加</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 她忘记活动日期了</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Inviting a friend and recording the next date support wanting to return.</p><p class="cn">问能否带朋友又记下日期，支持愿意再参加。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 问老师下次能不能带朋友一起参加。我已经把下次活动的日期写进日历了</p><ul><li>B: The later actions do not support deciding never to return.<br>后来的行为不支持决定不再去。</li><li>C: She explicitly recorded the next date.<br>她明确已经记下日期。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 20 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 20 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to a rainy-weekend change</h2><p>Reply to Xiaolin in Chinese. Say whether you can meet at the community centre at two on Saturday and whether you prefer cooking or drawing. Give a reason for your activity choice. Suggest another workable arrangement or ask one relevant question. You may invent details. About 40-60 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小周：星期六下雨，公园活动改在社区中心，下午两点开始。你能来吗？你想参加做饭还是画画？我两种都可以。<br>小林</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">小林，我周六两点能到社区中心。我想画画，因为我喜欢画花。请问要自己带纸和笔吗？谢谢你告诉我活动的变化。</p></div><ul><li>Answer whether you can meet at the stated time and place.</li><li>Choose cooking or drawing, or explain a feasible alternative.</li><li>Give a reason related to the activity choice.</li><li>Suggest a workable alternative or ask a relevant question.</li></ul><h3>Alternative example</h3><p class="cn">小林，我周六两点有课，三点到可以吗？我想学做饭，因为平时很少自己做。活动三点以后还可以参加吗？</p><ul><li>A polite decline with a feasible alternative is valid.</li><li>Do not require a preferred activity or a fixed grammar pattern.</li><li>Check all four observations; the sample is not the only answer.</li></ul><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Answer whether you can meet at the stated time and place.；Choose cooking or drawing, or explain a feasible alternative.；Give a reason related to the activity choice.；Suggest a workable alternative or ask a relevant question.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Describe a community activity</h2><p>Use the fictional activity card to tell a classmate about last Saturday. Include when and where it happened, describe at least two activities in sequence, and give one feeling or reason. Write connected Chinese sentences. About 80-120 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. You may add plausible details without contradicting the card.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">时间：上周六上午<br>地点：社区中心<br>九点：和老师做小纸灯<br>十点：和同学学做面条<br>十二点：一起吃午饭<br>结束后：把纸灯送给家人<br>感受：自己选择，也可以写不喜欢的地方并说明原因</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">上周六上午，我和同学去社区中心参加活动。我们九点先跟老师做小纸灯，十点再学做面条。第一次做面条不太容易，但是大家一起帮忙。十二点，我们吃了自己做的午饭。活动结束后，我把纸灯送给家人。我觉得这一天很有意思，因为我学会了新的东西。</p></div><ul><li>Identify last Saturday morning.</li><li>Identify the community centre.</li><li>Describe one activity from the card.</li><li>Describe a second activity with a consistent sequence.</li><li>Give one feeling or a reason.</li></ul><ul><li>Allow any supported feeling, including a negative one with a reason.</li><li>No need to reproduce every clock time.</li><li>Copied labels alone give limited evidence of connected expression.</li></ul><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Identify last Saturday morning.；Identify the community centre.；Describe one activity from the card.；Describe a second activity with a consistent sequence.；Give one feeling or a reason.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Arrange a meal and a meeting</h2><p>A classmate is arranging Saturday lunch with you. Respond in Chinese to four fixed audio prompts. Each prompt plays twice; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and up to 25 seconds to record. Invent details if you wish. Four responses form one task out of eight; the recording does not adapt to your answers.</p><p>The classmate asks about food needs, offers two meals, asks for your reason, and then introduces a later meeting time.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">星期六一起吃午饭吧。你有什么不想吃的，或者不能吃的东西？</p><p class="cn">Example: 我不想吃太辣的东西。我想吃清淡一点儿的菜。</p><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">店里有米饭，也有面条。你想选哪一种？也可以选别的。</p><p class="cn">Example: 我想选面条。鸡蛋面就可以。</p><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">你为什么想这样选？请给我说一个理由。</p><p class="cn">Example: 因为我昨天吃过米饭了，今天想换一种。</p><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">我十二点有事，一点才能到。你方便吗？不方便的话，可以怎么改？</p><p class="cn">Example: 一点可以，我一点在饭店门口等你。</p><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：State a food need or say there is no restriction.；Choose rice, noodles or another relevant option.；Give a reason; judge relevance to the learner’s own previous choice.；Accept the new time with a workable arrangement or propose an alternative.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Choose a weekend activity</h2><p>Use the two activity cards to recommend one plan to a classmate who is free from one to five on Saturday, has at most thirty yuan, and prefers not to be outside in the rain. Compare the options, state your choice, give two reasons based on the cards, and describe a short workable plan. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 90 seconds to speak. Other choices are valid if you explain how their constraints can be managed.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">周六下午可能下雨。<br>甲：社区中心做饭课，下午两点到四点，室内，二十五元；从车站走五分钟。<br>乙：公园散步，下午一点半到三点，室外，免费；从车站走十五分钟；可借伞。<br>同学：一点到五点有空，最多三十元，希望不在雨里活动。</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">我建议选甲。两个活动我们都有时间参加，乙不用花钱，甲要二十五元。不过甲在室内，下午可能下雨，在社区中心更方便。二十五元也没有超过三十元。我们可以一点半在车站见，先走到社区中心，两点上课，四点结束。</p></div><ul><li>Compare at least one feature of both options.</li><li>Choose a plan.</li><li>Give a first evidence-based reason.</li><li>Give a second evidence-based reason.</li><li>Describe a short plan consistent with the time and place.</li></ul><h3>Alternative example</h3><p class="cn">如果同学愿意借伞，也可以选乙，因为免费，时间也合适。不过乙在室外，可能会淋雨，要先问同学是否愿意改变偏好。我们一点在车站见，一点半开始散步。</p><ul><li>A is straightforward; B is acceptable only with explicit handling of the rain preference.</li><li>Do not judge accent similarity to a native speaker.</li><li>A recording shorter than ninety seconds can fully complete the task.</li></ul><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Compare at least one feature of both options.；Choose a plan.；Give a first evidence-based reason.；Give a second evidence-based reason.；Describe a short plan consistent with the time and place.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务列出的主要要求，理由或安排与情境一致。</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></main></body></html>